# Adapted 2026-10-24. Original: kokoryh/Sparkle (GPL-3.0), Kelee rules.
# Preview: offline tests only; see README and source package for limitations.
name: 哔哩哔哩评论去广告 · 可选
desc: 仅处理评论 MainList 响应，不重发请求、不访问空降服务器。加载慢时先停用此模块；主模块默认评论直通。
category: 去广告
version: 2026.10.24-preview.2
homepage: https://github.com/xian2023/stash-modules
http:
  mitm:
    - grpc.biliapi.net
    - app.bilibili.com
  script:
    - match: ^https://(?:grpc\.biliapi\.net|app\.bilibili\.com)/bilibili\.main\.community\.reply\.v1\.Reply/MainList$
      name: bili-kokoryh-response-eadd23627062f196
      type: response
      require-body: true
      binary-mode: true
      timeout: 1
      max-size: 1048576
      argument: '{"purifyComment":true,"sponsorBlock":false,"logLevel":"off"}'
script-providers:
  bili-kokoryh-response-eadd23627062f196:
    url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xian2023/stash-modules/main/scripts/bilibili/eadd23627062f196/response.js
    interval: 86400
